  "description": "CR 513.1, 701.16a, 111.10f, 119.3, 603.6c, 603.10a: Teysa, Opulent Oligarch investigates at its controller's end step once for each opponent who lost life that turn, and makes a 1/1 white and black flying Spirit when a Clue its controller controls goes to a graveyard from the battlefield, only once each turn",
  "note": "On turn 1 bob loses life to Teysa's attack, carol loses none and alice loses 2 to her own Sign in Blood: one Clue, not two or three. Sacrificing that Clue token makes a Spirit; sacrificing a nontoken Clue (Knife) the same turn makes none. bob's Rope on his turn makes alice none (a Clue she doesn't control); her second Knife on turn 4 makes one, since the limit is each turn. On turn 4 no opponent lost life, so the end step investigates zero times.",
